<http://gcrc.carleton.ca/ontologies/2023/GCRC_CEBP_Genome_Architecture/DNA_Alphabet>
  a owl:NamedIndividual, <http://w3id.org/vcb/fel#MetaphoricReference> ;
  dc:description """Genetic information (DNA) has a language like Inuktitut or English
English alphabet: ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ
Genetic alphabet of DNA has only four ‘letters’: G, A, T and C""" ;
  dc:source """Thompson, H., Colston, L., Elliott, G., Chabot, A. 2023. Eastern Massasauga Rattlesnake
Genomics Workshop: Summary Report. Canadian Species Initiative (CSI), Cambridge, ON,
CAN""" .

<http://gcrc.carleton.ca/ontologies/2023/GCRC_CEBP_Genome_Architecture/DNA_Language>
  a owl:NamedIndividual, <http://w3id.org/vcb/fel#MetaphoricReference> ;
  dc:description """Genetic information (DNA) has a language like Inuktitut or English
English alphabet: ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ
Genetic alphabet of DNA has only four ‘letters’: G, A, T and C""" ;
